      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but it feels like you're completely dismissing the entire argument for free trade. aren't economists generally of the opinion that these kinds of agreements lead to long-term prosperity and overall economic growth for the country, even if there's some friction in certain sectors? why is it that you're viewing it through such a negative lens instead of looking at the broader economic picture?",
